Package: structure.stage
Title: Spatial Workflows for Vegetation Structural-Stage Classification
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Josh", "Erickson", email = "joshualerickson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prepare stand-derived training samples, construct spatially grouped
    resamples, and fit gradient boosting models with spatial forward feature
    selection. Provides explicit data contracts and reproducible model bundles
    for extending a LiDAR vegetation structural-stage training workflow.
